    "bm.index.method.1": "Every site uses its own scale: Elo on arena.ai, percentages for tests, Artificial Analysis has its own index. So each board is first turned into a percentile — the share of models on that board that score lower (0 is last place, 100 is first). When a model has several variants (with and without reasoning), the best one counts.",
